Scope

The MIT license above covers this repository's own code and documentation,
except for the parts listed below, which stay under the GNU General Public
License version 3 (the full text is in LICENSE-GPL-3.0):

- ext/kzgs, ext/kzipu, ext/kzspu2 and ext/kzvu, which wrap and build PCSX2
  code (GPL-3.0-or-later).
- ext/PS2Recomp, a submodule under its own GPL-3.0 license.
- The field of view settings contributed by Ash01Live (commit 648301a),
  unless they agree to relicense them.
- Every released build (killzone.exe and the release zips), because it links
  PCSX2 and PS2Recomp. Builds made from this code are GPL-3.0 as well.

Third-party files keep their own licenses: ext/kzgs/shaders/SMAA-LICENSE.txt,
ext/kzgs/third_party/smaa/LICENSE.txt and
resources/prompts/Kenney-Input-Prompts-License.txt (CC0).
